<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Tableau de bord — MBG</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="public/css/admin-styles.css"></head><body class="admin">
<%- include('partials/admin-sidebar', { active: 'dashboard' }) %>
<% var _s=(typeof stats!=='undefined'&&stats)?stats:{}; var _r=(typeof recent!=='undefined'&&recent)?recent:[]; %>
<main class="admin-main">
<header class="admin-top"><button class="side-toggle" type="button" onclick="document.body.classList.toggle('side-open')" aria-label="Menu">≡</button><div class="tt"><h1>Tableau de bord</h1><p class="admin-sub">Vos rushs, votre progression et vos demandes de travail.</p></div><a class="btn-ghost" href="." target="_blank">↗ Voir le site</a></header>
<section class="stat-cards">
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 9l6-3v12l-6-3"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.videos||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Rushs</span></span></div>
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.timeline||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Clips timeline</span></span></div>
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.prestations||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Prestations</span></span></div>
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.posts||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Articles</span></span></div>
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.5 5h13l3.5 7v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6z"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.submissions||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Demandes</span></span></div>
<div class="stat"><span class="stat-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7-11-7-11-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><span class="stat-txt"><span class="stat-n"><%= _s.recentVisits||0 %></span><span class="stat-l">Visites (7 j)</span></span></div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-head"><h2>Gérer le contenu</h2></div>
<div class="mod-grid">
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/videos"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 9l6-3v12l-6-3"/></svg></span><h3>Rushs</h3><span class="mc-count" style="background-color:#6366F1;color:#fff"><%= _s.videos||0 %></span></span><p>La galerie de montages et la vidéo à la une.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/timeline_clips"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Timeline</h3><span class="mc-count" style="background-color:#6366F1;color:#fff"><%= _s.timeline||0 %></span></span><p>La progression, clip par clip, avec comparatifs avant/après.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/prestations"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg></span><h3>Prestations</h3><span class="mc-count" style="background-color:#6366F1;color:#fff"><%= _s.prestations||0 %></span></span><p>Vos offres : ce que vous faites, pour qui, délai et tarif.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/posts"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/></svg></span><h3>Articles</h3><span class="mc-count" style="background-color:#6366F1;color:#fff"><%= _s.posts||0 %></span></span><p>Notes et méthode de montage.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/submissions"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.5 5h13l3.5 7v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6z"/></svg></span><h3>Demandes</h3><span class="mc-count" style="background-color:#6366F1;color:#fff"><%= _s.submissions||0 %></span></span><p>Les demandes de travail reçues via le formulaire.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
<a class="mod-card" href="admin/settings"><span class="mc-top"><span class="mc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1-1.51 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00.33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 110-4h.09a1.65 1.65 0 001.51-1 1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 001.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 114 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 110 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z"/></svg></span><h3>Réglages</h3></span><p>Courriel de réception et liens sociaux du pied de page.</p><span class="mc-go">Gérer →</span></a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-head"><h2>Dernières demandes</h2><a class="link" href="admin/submissions">Tout voir →</a></div>
<% if (_r && _r.length) { %>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>Nom</th><th>Type</th><th>Message</th><th>Reçue</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% _r.forEach(function(s){ %><tr><td><%= s.name %></td><td><%= s.project_type || '—' %></td><td><%= (s.message||'').slice(0,60) %></td><td><%= new Date(s.created_at).toLocaleDateString('fr-CA') %></td></tr><% }); %>
</tbody></table></div>
<% } else { %><div class="admin-empty">Aucune demande pour l'instant. Elles apparaîtront ici dès qu'un visiteur remplira le formulaire de contact.</div><% } %>
</section>
</main>
</body></html>
